        ladder: [
            TerraformStep(
                order: 1,
                title: "Find the one-bar level and stay there",
                mechanism: "A gas giant has no surface, so the only fixed reference is a pressure level, and the one that matters is one bar. Above it the atmosphere is too thin to breathe and too cold; below it the pressure and temperature climb without limit until hydrogen turns metallic. The one-bar level is therefore not a compromise but the only habitable altitude, and everything else follows from what is true there.",
