                mechanism: "A gas giant is a chemical plant that needs no mining. Hydrogen and helium can be scooped directly from the airstream at the habitat's own altitude, and helium-3, which is almost absent on Earth and is the cleanest fusion fuel known, is present at parts per million of a very large number. Water clouds sit a few scale heights below and ammonia above. Nothing has to be landed on, launched from, or dug out, and the escape velocity that makes export expensive is the same gravity that keeps the habitat's altitude stable.",
                quantities: [
