                ],
                timescale: "incremental; useful from the first hectare",
                maturity: .speculative,
                source: "Taylor 1992, JBIS 45, 341; Fogg 1995, ch. 11 (paraterraforming)"
            )
        ],
        caveats: [
            "Every step past the first is an extrapolation from physics that is itself well established. The physics is not in doubt; the engineering has never been attempted at any scale."
