                title: "Radiation",
                severity: .none,
                statement: "Unshielded surface dose is 1.00e-3 Sv per year, 0.4 times Earth's natural background and 0.1 times the occupational limit. Nobody has ever been harmed by a dose rate like this; it is the background a person already lives in.",
                quantities: [
